# Keep build context lean. .gitignore-style; applies to every Dockerfile build.

# deps + build outputs
**/node_modules
**/dist
**/.next
**/.bun
**/build
**/coverage
**/*.tsbuildinfo

# vcs / editor / OS
.git
.gitignore
.idea
.vscode
*.swp
.DS_Store

# secrets & local env (never enter the image)
**/.env
**/.env.local
**/.env.*.local
**/.env.prod
.env
*.local

# logs
**/*.log

# docs / ops (not needed at build time)
docs
ops
README.md
CLAUDE.md
**/CLAUDE.md
